774
00:56:51,260 --> 00:56:55,510
But not only that, 17 is
an important number.

775
00:56:55,510 --> 00:56:56,320
It's a Fermat number.

776
00:56:56,320 --> 00:56:59,480
It's a Fermat prime.

777
00:56:59,480 --> 00:57:03,670
Fermat numbers are 2 to the 2 to
the, and so on up the line.

778
00:57:03,670 --> 00:57:08,580
And Fermat had suggested
that all such

779
00:57:08,580 --> 00:57:11,640
