780
00:57:11,640 --> 00:57:16,070
And they're not.

781
00:57:16,070 --> 00:57:20,670
In fact, the only numbers which
are known to be Fermat

782
00:57:20,670 --> 00:57:30,910
primes are the ones at the
bottom 6, or 0, 1, 2, 3, and 4

783
00:57:30,910 --> 00:57:37,950
are the only known primes, and
F2, which is 2 to the 2 to the

784
00:57:37,950 --> 00:57:40,030
2 plus 1 is seventeen.

785
00:57:40,030 --> 00:57:46,080
And so it is one of the
only known primes

786
00:57:46,080 --> 00:57:49,000
generated by this formula.

787
00:57:49,000 --> 00:57:54,557
So obviously, 17 had to be the
last flight to the moon.

788
00:57:57,360 --> 00:58:00,750
