01:10:54,470 --> 01:11:04,820
But no, I don't know whether
he was actually

984
01:11:04,820 --> 01:11:06,230
serious about it.

985
01:11:06,230 --> 01:11:13,130
He did write a letter to Bob
Seamans saying that he would

986
01:11:13,130 --> 01:11:15,280
