cooperate with the Russians,

1072
01:17:17,830 --> 01:17:19,310
there wouldn't be a program.

1073
01:17:32,330 --> 01:17:33,580
What was I going to say?

1074
01:17:40,378 --> 01:17:42,240
I've forgotten what I
was going to say.

1075
01:17:42,240 --> 01:17:49,990
But anyhow, there are so many
opportunities that we

1076
01:17:49,990 --> 01:17:56,640
