1086
01:18:52,780 --> 01:19:01,200
And I think that that is true,
that with an application,

1087
01:19:01,200 --> 01:19:03,770
demand, you're going
to learn how to do

1088
01:19:03,770 --> 01:19:05,020
it better and cheaper.

1089
01:19:21,330 --> 01:19:21,770
OK.

1090
01:19:21,770 --> 01:19:22,970
